      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "浏览器检查产物说明",
        "reason": "说明 README 声称检查会产生验证摘要和截图，但未给出它们与 `test-results/` 的路径对应关系。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/prototype/README.md",
          "startLine": 32,
          "endLine": 39
        },
        "quote": "## 浏览器检查\n\n```bash\nnpx playwright install chromium\nnpm test\n```\n\n已有浏览器时可用 `OMEM_CHROMIUM=/path/to/chrome npm test` 指定。测试用 `file://` 打开 HTML，检查长链、环、版本、圈选与追问、同步、恢复、搜索、移动布局及零外部请求；输出 [verification.json](verification.json) 与截图。"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
